# ==============================================================================
# Analysis Snippet: RDF + MSD (compute rdf / compute msd + fix ave/time)
# Apply when: production MD where radial distribution functions or diffusion
#             coefficients are needed (liquid structure, transport)
# ==============================================================================
# USAGE:
# - compute rdf <Nbins> itype jtype ...: type pairs refer to DATA-FILE type IDs.
# - fix ave/time Nevery Nrepeat Nfreq ... mode vector: writes time-averaged arrays.
# - Also available (not shown): compute coord/atom (coordination numbers) and
#   compute orientorder/atom (Q6 bond-orientational order parameter).

# --- RDF (e.g. O-O, O-H in water: types 1=O, 2=H) ---
# >>> USER: adjust Nbins and the type pairs to your data file <<<
compute         rdf1 all rdf 200 1 1 1 2 2 2
fix             frdf all ave/time 100 10 1000 c_rdf1[*] file rdf.dat mode vector

# --- MSD (mean-squared displacement; slope -> diffusion coefficient) ---
compute         msd1 all msd
fix             fmsd all ave/time 100 10 1000 c_msd1[*] file msd.dat mode vector

# --- Per-atom structure probes (dump as custom attributes if needed) ---
# compute         coord all coord/atom cutoff 3.5
# compute         q6 all orientorder/atom degrees 6
